msgid ":mod:`!turtle` --- Turtle graphics"
msgstr ":mod:`!turtle` --- タートルグラフィックス"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:8
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/turtle.py`"
msgstr "**ソースコード:** :source:`Lib/turtle.py`"

msgid ""
"Turtle can draw intricate shapes using programs that repeat simple moves."
msgstr "単純な動きを繰り返すプログラムで、タートルは複雑な図形を描けます。"

msgid "A yellow starburst of thin spikes with a red outline, drawn by turtle."
msgstr ""
"タートルで描いた、細い突起が放射状に並ぶ黄色い星形。\n"
"輪郭は赤い。"

msgid ""
"Imagine a robotic turtle starting at (0, 0) in the x-y plane. After an "
"``import turtle``, give it the command ``turtle.forward(15)``, and it moves "
"(on-screen!) 15 pixels in the direction it is facing, drawing a line as it "
"moves. Give it the command ``turtle.right(25)``, and it rotates in-place 25 "
"degrees clockwise."
msgstr ""
"x-y 平面の (0, 0) から動き出す、亀のロボットを想像してください。\n"
"``import turtle`` の後に ``turtle.forward(15)`` と指示すると、向いている方向"
"に (画面上で！) 15 ピクセル進みながら線を描きます。\n"
"``turtle.right(25)`` と指示すると、その場で時計回りに 25 度回転します。"

msgid ""
"Turtle graphics is an implementation of `the drawing tools introduced in "
"Logo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turtle_(robot)>`__ in 1967. It was "
"created as an educational tool, and its instant, visible feedback makes it "
"an effective way for learners to encounter programming concepts. It is also "
"a convenient way to produce simple graphical output without bringing in "
"external libraries."
msgstr ""
"タートルグラフィックスは、1967 年に `Logo に導入された描画ツール <https://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Turtle_(robot)>`__ の実装です。\n"
"教育用のツールとして作られ、結果がすぐに目に見えるため、プログラミングの概念"
"に触れる効果的な学習手段になります。\n"
"外部ライブラリを導入せずに、簡単な図形を出力する方法としても便利です。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:48
msgid "This document includes four main sections:"
msgstr "この文書には大きく分けて 4 つの節があります:"

msgid ":ref:`turtle-tutorial` teaches the basics of turtle drawing."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-tutorial` では、タートルによる描画の基本を学びます。"

msgid ""
":ref:`turtle-reference` describes the functions, methods and classes this "
"module defines."
msgstr ""
":ref:`turtle-reference` では、このモジュールが定義する関数、メソッド、クラス"
"を説明します。"

msgid ":ref:`turtle-howtos` detail how to handle specific tasks."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-howtos` では、特定の作業を行う方法を詳しく説明します。"

msgid ""
":ref:`turtle-explanation` provides background on the object-oriented "
"interface."
msgstr ""
":ref:`turtle-explanation` では、オブジェクト指向インターフェースの背景を説明"
"します。"

msgid ""
"Turtle graphics requires the :mod:`tkinter` :term:`optional module`. The "
"python.org installers for Windows and macOS include it, but some Linux "
"distributions and other platforms may package it separately. If ``import "
"turtle`` fails with an error mentioning ``_tkinter``, look for documentation "
"from your distributor (that is, whoever provided Python to you). Check this "
"in advance if you're planning to use turtle graphics with a learner."
msgstr ""
"タートルグラフィックスには、:term:`オプションモジュール <optional module>` "
"の :mod:`tkinter` が必要です。\n"
"python.org の Windows 用と macOS 用のインストーラには含まれていますが、一部"
"の Linux ディストリビューションや他のプラットフォームでは、別のパッケージに"
"なっている場合があります。\n"
"``import turtle`` が ``_tkinter`` に関するエラーで失敗した場合は、配布元 "
"(Python を提供した組織など) のドキュメントを探してください。\n"
"学習者とタートルグラフィックスを使う予定であれば、事前に確認しておきましょ"
"う。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:72
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "チュートリアル"

msgid ""
"New users should start here. In this tutorial we'll explore some of the "
"basics of turtle drawing."
msgstr ""
"初めて使う方はここから始めてください。\n"
"このチュートリアルでは、タートルによる描画の基本をいくつか学びます。"

msgid "Starting a turtle environment"
msgstr "タートルの環境を起動する"

msgid "In a Python shell, import all the objects of the ``turtle`` module::"
msgstr ""
"Python シェルで、``turtle`` モジュールのすべてのオブジェクトをインポートしま"
"す。 ::"

msgid "from turtle import *"
msgstr "from turtle import *"

msgid ""
"If you run into a ``Standard library module '_tkinter' was not found`` "
"error, you'll have to install the :mod:`Tk interface package <tkinter>` on "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"``Standard library module '_tkinter' was not found`` というエラーが出た場合"
"は、システムに :mod:`Tk インターフェースのパッケージ <tkinter>` をインストー"
"ルする必要があります。"

msgid ""
"Nothing appears yet. To open the turtle window, make the turtle visible::"
msgstr ""
"まだ何も表示されません。\n"
"タートルを表示して、ウィンドウを開きましょう。 ::"

msgid "showturtle()"
msgstr "showturtle()"

msgid ""
"A new window opens, with the turtle in the middle, shown as an arrow heading "
"East."
msgstr "新しいウィンドウが開き、中央に東向きの矢印でタートルが表示されます。"

msgid "Basic drawing"
msgstr "基本的な描画"

msgid "Send the turtle forward 100 steps::"
msgstr "タートルを 100 歩前進させます。 ::"

msgid "forward(100)"
msgstr "forward(100)"

msgid ""
"You should see a line drawn by the turtle, heading East. Change the "
"direction of the turtle, so that it turns 120 degrees left (anti-clockwise)::"
msgstr ""
"タートルが東に向かって描いた線が見えるはずです。\n"
"タートルの向きを変え、左に (反時計回りに) 120 度回転させましょう。 ::"

msgid "left(120)"
msgstr "left(120)"

msgid "Let's continue by drawing a triangle::"
msgstr "続けて三角形を描いてみましょう。 ::"

msgid ""
"forward(100)\n"
"left(120)\n"
"forward(100)"
msgstr ""
"forward(100)\n"
"left(120)\n"
"forward(100)"

msgid ""
"Notice how the turtle, represented by an arrow, points in different "
"directions as you steer it."
msgstr ""
"方向を指示すると、矢印で表されたタートルの向きが変わることに注目してくださ"
"い。"

msgid ""
"Experiment with those commands, and also with ``backward()`` and "
"``right()``. Many commands also have shorter aliases, such as ``fd()`` for :"
"func:`forward`."
msgstr ""
"これらのコマンドと、``backward()``、``right()`` も試してみてください。\n"
"多くのコマンドには、:func:`forward` に対する ``fd()`` のような短い別名もあり"
"ます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:124 ../../library/turtle.rst:811
msgid "Pen control"
msgstr "Pen の制御"

msgid ""
"Try changing the color - for example, ``color('blue')`` - and width of the "
"line - for example, ``width(3)`` - and then drawing again."
msgstr ""
"例えば ``color('blue')`` で色を、``width(3)`` で線の幅を変えて、もう一度描い"
"てみてください。"

msgid ""
"You can also move the turtle around without drawing, by lifting up the pen: "
"``up()`` before moving. To start drawing again, use ``down()``."
msgstr ""
"移動前に ``up()`` でペンを上げると、線を描かずにタートルを移動することもでき"
"ます。\n"
"再び描き始めるには ``down()`` を使います。"

msgid "The turtle's position"
msgstr "タートルの位置"

msgid ""
"Send your turtle back to its starting-point (useful if it has disappeared "
"off-screen)::"
msgstr ""
"タートルを開始位置に戻します (画面の外に出て見えなくなったときに便利で"
"す)。 ::"

msgid "home()"
msgstr "home()"

msgid ""
"The home position is at the center of the turtle's screen. If you ever need "
"to know them, get the turtle's x-y coordinates with::"
msgstr ""
"開始位置はタートルの画面の中央です。\n"
"タートルの x-y 座標を知りたいときは、次のように取得できます。 ::"

msgid "pos()"
msgstr "pos()"

msgid "Home is at ``(0, 0)``."
msgstr "開始位置は ``(0, 0)`` です。"

msgid ""
"And after a while, it will probably help to clear the window so we can start "
"anew::"
msgstr "しばらく試したら、画面を消去してやり直すとよいでしょう。 ::"

msgid "clearscreen()"
msgstr "clearscreen()"

msgid "Making algorithmic patterns"
msgstr "アルゴリズムで模様を描く"

msgid "Using loops, it's possible to build up geometric patterns::"
msgstr "ループを使うと、幾何学的な模様を描けます。 ::"

msgid ""
"for steps in range(100):\n"
"    for c in ('blue', 'red', 'green'):\n"
"        color(c)\n"
"        forward(steps)\n"
"        right(30)"
msgstr ""
"for steps in range(100):\n"
"    for c in ('blue', 'red', 'green'):\n"
"        color(c)\n"
"        forward(steps)\n"
"        right(30)"

msgid "\\ - which of course, are limited only by the imagination!"
msgstr "どんな模様ができるかは、もちろん想像力次第です！"

msgid ""
"Let's draw the star shape at the top of this page. We want red lines, filled "
"in with yellow::"
msgstr ""
"このページの一番上にある星形を描いてみましょう。\n"
"赤い線で描き、中を黄色で塗りつぶします。 ::"

msgid ""
"color('red')\n"
"fillcolor('yellow')"
msgstr ""
"color('red')\n"
"fillcolor('yellow')"

msgid ""
"Just as ``up()`` and ``down()`` determine whether lines will be drawn, "
"filling can be turned on and off::"
msgstr ""
"``up()`` と ``down()`` で線を描くかどうかを切り替えるのと同じように、塗りつぶ"
"しも開始・終了できます。 ::"

msgid "begin_fill()"
msgstr "begin_fill()"

msgid "Next we'll create a loop::"
msgstr "次にループを作ります。 ::"

msgid ""
"start = pos()\n"
"\n"
"while True:\n"
"    forward(200)\n"
"    left(170)\n"
"    if distance(start) < 1:\n"
"        break"
msgstr ""
"start = pos()\n"
"\n"
"while True:\n"
"    forward(200)\n"
"    left(170)\n"
"    if distance(start) < 1:\n"
"        break"

msgid ""
"``distance(start) < 1`` is a good way to know when the turtle is back at its "
"start position."
msgstr ""
"タートルが開始位置に戻ったかどうかは、``distance(start) < 1`` でうまく判定で"
"きます。"

msgid "Finally, complete the filling::"
msgstr "最後に塗りつぶしを完了します。 ::"

msgid "end_fill()"
msgstr "end_fill()"

msgid ""
"(Note that filling only actually takes place when you give the "
"``end_fill()`` command.)"
msgstr ""
"(実際に塗りつぶされるのは、``end_fill()`` コマンドを実行したときだけです。)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:204
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "リファレンス"

msgid "Turtle methods and functions"
msgstr "タートルのメソッドと関数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:212
msgid ""
"Most of the examples in this section refer to a Turtle instance called "
"``turtle``."
msgstr ""
"この節のほとんどの例では ``turtle`` という名前の Turtle インスタンスを使いま"
"す。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:218
msgid "Move and draw"
msgstr "移動および描画"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメーター"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:223 ../../library/turtle.rst:245
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:269 ../../library/turtle.rst:295
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:393 ../../library/turtle.rst:415
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:438 ../../library/turtle.rst:489
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:764 ../../library/turtle.rst:1298
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1745 ../../library/turtle.rst:1746
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1747 ../../library/turtle.rst:1748
msgid "a number"
msgstr "数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:225
msgid ""
"Move the turtle forward by the specified *distance*, in the direction the "
"turtle is headed."
msgstr ""
"タートルが頭を向けている方へ、タートルを距離 *distance* だけ前進させます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(25)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(25.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(-75)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-50.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(25)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(25.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(-75)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-50.00,0.00)"

msgid ""
"Move the turtle backward by *distance*, opposite to the direction the turtle "
"is headed. The turtle's heading does not change."
msgstr ""
"タートルを、向いている方向とは逆に *distance* だけ後退させます。\n"
"タートルの向きは変わりません。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.backward(30)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-30.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.backward(30)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-30.00,0.00)"

msgid ""
"Turn the turtle right by the specified *angle*. The angle is measured in "
"degrees by default; the unit can be changed with :func:`degrees` or :func:"
"`radians`. How the heading is measured depends on the turtle mode, see :func:"
"`mode`."
msgstr ""
"タートルを指定された *angle* だけ右に回転させます。\n"
"角度の単位はデフォルトでは度ですが、:func:`degrees` または :func:`radians` で"
"変更できます。\n"
"向きの測り方はタートルのモードによって変わります。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.right(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"337.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.right(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"337.0"

msgid ""
"Turn the turtle left by the specified *angle*. The angle is measured in "
"degrees by default; the unit can be changed with :func:`degrees` or :func:"
"`radians`. How the heading is measured depends on the turtle mode, see :func:"
"`mode`."
msgstr ""
"タートルを指定された *angle* だけ左に回転させます。\n"
"角度の単位はデフォルトでは度ですが、:func:`degrees` または :func:`radians` で"
"変更できます。\n"
"向きの測り方はタートルのモードによって変わります。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.left(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.left(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:322
msgid "a number or a pair/vector of numbers"
msgstr "数または数のペア/ベクトル"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:323 ../../library/turtle.rst:355
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:356 ../../library/turtle.rst:490
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1973 ../../library/turtle.rst:1974
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1975 ../../library/turtle.rst:2021
msgid "a number or ``None``"
msgstr "数または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Move the turtle to an absolute position. If *y* is ``None``, *x* must be a "
"pair of coordinates or a :class:`Vec2D`, for example as returned by :func:"
"`pos`. If the pen is down, a line is drawn. The turtle's heading does not "
"change."
msgstr ""
"タートルを絶対位置に移動します。\n"
"*y* が ``None`` の場合、*x* は座標のペア、または :func:`pos` が返すような :"
"class:`Vec2D` でなければなりません。\n"
"ペンが下りていると線を描きます。\n"
"タートルの向きは変わりません。"

msgid ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(60,30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,30.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto((20,80))\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,80.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(tp)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(60,30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,30.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto((20,80))\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,80.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(tp)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:357
msgid "a boolean"
msgstr "ブール値"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:359
msgid ""
"Move turtle to an absolute position. Unlike goto(x, y), a line will not be "
"drawn. The turtle's orientation does not change. If currently filling, the "
"polygon(s) teleported from will be filled after leaving, and filling will "
"begin again after teleporting. This can be disabled with fill_gap=True, "
"which makes the imaginary line traveled during teleporting act as a fill "
"barrier like in goto(x, y)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(60)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(y=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(20, 30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,30.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(60)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(y=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(20, 30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,30.00)"

msgid "Set the turtle's x coordinate to *x*. The y coordinate is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"タートルの x 座標を *x* に設定します。\n"
"y 座標は変わりません。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.setx(10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(10.00,240.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.setx(10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(10.00,240.00)"

msgid "Set the turtle's y coordinate to *y*. The x coordinate is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"タートルの y 座標を *y* に設定します。\n"
"x 座標は変わりません。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,40.00)\n"
">>> turtle.sety(-10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,40.00)\n"
">>> turtle.sety(-10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)"

msgid ""
"Set the turtle's heading to *to_angle*. Here are some common directions in "
"degrees:"
msgstr ""
"タートルの向きを *to_angle* に設定します。\n"
"代表的な方向を度で表すと、次のようになります。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:444
msgid "standard mode"
msgstr "標準モード"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:444
msgid "logo mode"
msgstr "logo モード"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:446
msgid "0 - east"
msgstr "0 - 東"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:446
msgid "0 - north"
msgstr "0 - 北"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:447
msgid "90 - north"
msgstr "90 - 北"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:447
msgid "90 - east"
msgstr "90 - 東"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:448
msgid "180 - west"
msgstr "180 - 西"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:448
msgid "180 - south"
msgstr "180 - 南"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:449
msgid "270 - south"
msgstr "270 - 南"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:449
msgid "270 - west"
msgstr "270 - 西"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.setheading(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.setheading(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"

msgid ""
"Move the turtle to the origin, coordinates (0,0). The turtle's heading is "
"set to its start orientation, which depends on the turtle mode, see :func:"
"`mode`."
msgstr ""
"タートルを原点、座標 (0,0) に移動します。\n"
"向きはモードに応じた初期の向きに設定されます。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:491 ../../library/turtle.rst:1550
msgid "an integer or ``None``"
msgstr "整数または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Draw a circle with the given *radius*. The center is *radius* units left of "
"the turtle; *extent*, an angle, determines which part of the circle is "
"drawn. If *extent* is not given, draw the entire circle. If *extent* is not "
"a full circle, one endpoint of the arc is the current pen position. Draw the "
"arc in counterclockwise direction if *radius* is positive, otherwise in "
"clockwise direction. Finally, the turtle's heading is changed by *extent*."
msgstr ""
"指定された *radius* を半径とする円を描きます。\n"
"中心はタートルから左に *radius* だけ離れた位置です。\n"
"角度 *extent* は、円のどの範囲を描くかを指定します。\n"
"*extent* を指定しなければ円全体を描きます。\n"
"*extent* が 1 周分でなければ、円弧の一方の端点は現在のペンの位置になりま"
"す。\n"
"*radius* が正なら反時計回り、それ以外なら時計回りに円弧を描きます。\n"
"最後に、タートルの向きは *extent* だけ変わります。"

msgid ""
"As the circle is approximated by an inscribed regular polygon, *steps* "
"determines the number of steps to use. If not given, it will be calculated "
"automatically. May be used to draw regular polygons."
msgstr ""
"円は内接する正多角形で近似するため、*steps* で使うステップ数を指定します。\n"
"指定しなければ自動的に計算します。\n"
"正多角形を描くためにも使えます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(120, 180)  # draw a semicircle\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"180.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(120, 180)  # 半円を描く\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"180.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:531
msgid "an integer >= 1 (if given)"
msgstr "1 以上の整数 (与えられる場合には)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:532
msgid "a colorstring or a numeric color tuple"
msgstr "色を表わす文字列またはタプル"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:534
msgid ""
"Draw a circular dot with diameter *size*, using *color*.  If *size* is not "
"given, the maximum of ``pensize+4`` and ``2*pensize`` is used."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.dot()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50); turtle.dot(20, \"blue\"); turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(100.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.dot()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50); turtle.dot(20, \"blue\"); turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(100.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:552
msgid ""
"Stamp a copy of the turtle shape onto the canvas at the current turtle "
"position.  Return a stamp_id for that stamp, which can be used to delete it "
"by calling ``clearstamp(stamp_id)``."
msgstr ""
"キャンバス上の現在タートルがいる位置にタートルの姿のハンコを押します。そのハ"
"ンコに対して stamp_id が返されますが、これを使うと後で "
"``clearstamp(stamp_id)`` のように呼び出して消すことができます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:566
msgid "an integer, must be return value of previous :func:`stamp` call"
msgstr "整数で、先立つ :func:`stamp` 呼出しで返された値でなければなりません"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:569
msgid "Delete stamp with given *stampid*."
msgstr "*stampid* に対応するハンコを消します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(150.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> astamp = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamp(astamp)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(150.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> astamp = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamp(astamp)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:588
msgid "an integer (or ``None``)"
msgstr "整数 (または ``None``)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:590
msgid ""
"Delete all or first/last *n* of turtle's stamps.  If *n* is ``None``, delete "
"all stamps, if *n* > 0 delete first *n* stamps, else if *n* < 0 delete last "
"*n* stamps."
msgstr ""
"全ての、または最初の/最後の *n* 個のハンコを消します。 *n* が ``None`` の場"
"合、全てのハンコを消します。 *n* が正の場合には最初の *n* 個、 *n* が負の場合"
"には最後の *n* 個を消します。"

msgid ""
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     unused_stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
"...     turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(-2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps()"
msgstr ""
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     unused_stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
"...     turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(-2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:607
msgid ""
"Undo (repeatedly) the last turtle action(s).  Number of available undo "
"actions is determined by the size of the undobuffer."
msgstr ""
"最後の(繰り返すことにより複数の)タートルの動きを取り消します。取り消しできる"
"動きの最大数は undobuffer のサイズによって決まります。"

msgid ""
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     turtle.fd(50); turtle.lt(80)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"
msgstr ""
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     turtle.fd(50); turtle.lt(80)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:622
msgid "an integer in the range 0..10 or a speedstring (see below)"
msgstr "0 から 10 までの整数またはスピードを表わす文字列(以下の説明を参照)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:624
msgid ""
"Set the turtle's speed to an integer value in the range 0..10.  If no "
"argument is given, return current speed."
msgstr ""
"タートルのスピードを 0 から 10 までの範囲の整数に設定します。引数が与えられな"
"い場合は現在のスピードを返します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:627
msgid ""
"If input is a number greater than 10 or smaller than 0.5, speed is set to "
"0.  Speedstrings are mapped to speedvalues as follows:"
msgstr ""
"与えられた数字が 10 より大きかったり 0.5 より小さかったりした場合は、スピード"
"は 0 になります。スピードを表わす文字列は次のように数字に変換されます:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:630
msgid "\"fastest\":  0"
msgstr "\"fastest\":  0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:631
msgid "\"fast\":  10"
msgstr "\"fast\":  10"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:632
msgid "\"normal\":  6"
msgstr "\"normal\":  6"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:633
msgid "\"slow\":  3"
msgstr "\"slow\":  3"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:634
msgid "\"slowest\":  1"
msgstr "\"slowest\":  1"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:636
msgid ""
"Speeds from 1 to 10 enforce increasingly faster animation of line drawing "
"and turtle turning."
msgstr ""
"1 から 10 までのスピードを上げていくにつれて線を描いたりタートルが回ったりす"
"るアニメーションがだんだん速くなります。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:639
msgid ""
"Attention: *speed* = 0 means that *no* animation takes place. forward/back "
"makes turtle jump and likewise left/right make the turtle turn instantly."
msgstr ""
"注意: *speed* = 0 はアニメーションを無くします。forward/backward ではタートル"
"がジャンプし、left/right では瞬時に方向を変えます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"3\n"
">>> turtle.speed('normal')\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"6\n"
">>> turtle.speed(9)\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"9"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"3\n"
">>> turtle.speed('normal')\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"6\n"
">>> turtle.speed(9)\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"9"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:657
msgid "Tell Turtle's state"
msgstr "Turtle の状態を知る"

msgid "Return the turtle's current location (x,y) as a :class:`Vec2D` vector."
msgstr "タートルの現在の位置 (x,y) を :class:`Vec2D` ベクトルとして返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(440.00,-0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(440.00,-0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:673 ../../library/turtle.rst:738
msgid "a number or a pair/vector of numbers or a turtle instance"
msgstr "数または数のペア/ベクトルまたはタートルのインスタンス"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:674 ../../library/turtle.rst:739
msgid "a number if *x* is a number, else ``None``"
msgstr "*x* が数ならば数、そうでなければ ``None``"

msgid ""
"Return the angle of the line from the turtle's position to (x,y). If *y* is "
"``None``, *x* must be a pair of coordinates, a :class:`Vec2D`, for example "
"as returned by :func:`pos`, or another turtle. The angle is measured from "
"the turtle's start orientation, which depends on the turtle mode, see :func:"
"`mode`."
msgstr ""
"タートルの位置から (x,y) に向かう線の角度を返します。\n"
"*y* が ``None`` の場合、*x* は座標のペア、:func:`pos` が返すような :class:"
"`Vec2D`、または別のタートルでなければなりません。\n"
"角度はタートルの初期の向きから測り、この向きはタートルのモードによって変わり"
"ます。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.goto(10, 10)\n"
">>> turtle.towards(0,0)\n"
"225.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.goto(10, 10)\n"
">>> turtle.towards(0,0)\n"
"225.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:692
msgid "Return the turtle's x coordinate."
msgstr "タートルの x 座標を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(50)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(64.28,76.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.xcor(), 5))\n"
"64.27876"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(50)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(64.28,76.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.xcor(), 5))\n"
"64.27876"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:708
msgid "Return the turtle's y coordinate."
msgstr "タートルの y 座標を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> print(turtle.pos())\n"
"(50.00,86.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.ycor(), 5))\n"
"86.60254"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> print(turtle.pos())\n"
"(50.00,86.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.ycor(), 5))\n"
"86.60254"

msgid ""
"Return the turtle's current heading. The value depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"タートルの現在の向きを返します。\n"
"値はタートルのモードによって変わります。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(67)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(67)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"

msgid ""
"Return the distance from the turtle to (x,y) in turtle step units. If *y* is "
"``None``, *x* must be a pair of coordinates, a :class:`Vec2D`, for example "
"as returned by :func:`pos`, or another turtle."
msgstr ""
"タートルから (x,y) までの距離を、タートルの歩幅を単位として返します。\n"
"*y* が ``None`` の場合、*x* は座標のペア、:func:`pos` が返すような :class:"
"`Vec2D`、または別のタートルでなければなりません。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.distance(30,40)\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> turtle.distance((30,40))\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> joe = Turtle()\n"
">>> joe.forward(77)\n"
">>> turtle.distance(joe)\n"
"77.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.distance(30,40)\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> turtle.distance((30,40))\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> joe = Turtle()\n"
">>> joe.forward(77)\n"
">>> turtle.distance(joe)\n"
"77.0"

msgid "Settings for measurement"
msgstr "測定の設定"

msgid ""
"Set the angle measurement units to degrees. The number of degrees in a full "
"circle is set to *fullcircle*, which defaults to 360."
msgstr ""
"角度の単位を度に設定します。\n"
"1 周分の角度は *fullcircle* に設定され、デフォルトは 360 です。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
"\n"
">>> # Change angle measurement unit to grad (also known as gon,\n"
">>> # grade, or gradian and equals 1/100-th of the right angle.)\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(400.0)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(360)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
"\n"
">>> # 角度の単位を grad に変更する (gon、grade、gradian とも呼ばれ、\n"
">>> # 直角の 1/100 に相当する)\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(400.0)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(360)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"

msgid ""
"Set the angle measurement units to radians.  Equivalent to ``degrees(2 * "
"math.pi)``."
msgstr ""
"角度の単位をラジアンに設定します。\n"
"``degrees(2 * math.pi)`` と同等です。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.radians()\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"1.5707963267948966"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.radians()\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"1.5707963267948966"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:814
msgid "Drawing state"
msgstr "描画状態"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:820
msgid "Pull the pen down -- drawing when moving."
msgstr "ペンを下ろします -- 動くと線が引かれます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:827
msgid "Pull the pen up -- no drawing when moving."
msgstr "ペンを上げます -- 動いても線は引かれません。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:833
msgid "a positive number"
msgstr "正の数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:835
msgid ""
"Set the line thickness to *width* or return it.  If resizemode is set to "
"\"auto\" and turtleshape is a polygon, that polygon is drawn with the same "
"line thickness.  If no argument is given, the current pensize is returned."
msgstr ""
"線の太さを *width* にするか、または現在の太さを返します。resizemode が "
"\"auto\" でタートルの形が多角形の場合、その多角形も同じ太さで描画されます。引"
"数が渡されなければ、現在の pensize が返されます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.pensize()\n"
"1\n"
">>> turtle.pensize(10)   # from here on lines of width 10 are drawn"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pensize()\n"
"1\n"
">>> turtle.pensize(10)   # これ以降は幅 10 の線を描く"

msgid "a dictionary with some or all of the below listed keys"
msgstr "以下のキーの一部またはすべてを持つ辞書"

msgid "one or more keyword-arguments with the below listed keys as keywords"
msgstr "以下のキーをキーワードとする、1 つ以上のキーワード引数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:852
msgid ""
"Return or set the pen's attributes in a \"pen-dictionary\" with the "
"following key/value pairs:"
msgstr ""
"ペンの属性を \"pen-dictionary\" に以下のキー/値ペアで設定するかまたは返しま"
"す:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:855
msgid "\"shown\": True/False"
msgstr "\"shown\": True/False"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:856
msgid "\"pendown\": True/False"
msgstr "\"pendown\": True/False"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:857
msgid "\"pencolor\": color-string or color-tuple"
msgstr "\"pencolor\": 色文字列または色タプル"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:858
msgid "\"fillcolor\": color-string or color-tuple"
msgstr "\"fillcolor\": 色文字列または色タプル"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:859
msgid "\"pensize\": positive number"
msgstr "\"pensize\": 正の数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:860
msgid "\"speed\": number in range 0..10"
msgstr "\"speed\": 0 から 10 までの整数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:861
msgid "\"resizemode\": \"auto\" or \"user\" or \"noresize\""
msgstr "\"resizemode\": \"auto\" または \"user\" または \"noresize\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:862
msgid "\"stretchfactor\": (positive number, positive number)"
msgstr "\"stretchfactor\": (正の数, 正の数)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:863
msgid "\"outline\": positive number"
msgstr "\"outline\": 正の数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:864
msgid "\"tilt\": number"
msgstr "\"tilt\": 数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:866
msgid ""
"This dictionary can be used as argument for a subsequent call to :func:`pen` "
"to restore the former pen-state.  Moreover one or more of these attributes "
"can be provided as keyword-arguments.  This can be used to set several pen "
"attributes in one statement."
msgstr ""
"この辞書を以降の :func:`pen` 呼出しに渡して以前のペンの状態に復旧することがで"
"きます。さらに一つ以上の属性をキーワード引数として渡すこともできます。一つの"
"文で幾つものペンの属性を設定するのに使えます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.pen(fillcolor=\"black\", pencolor=\"red\", pensize=10)\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())\n"
"[('fillcolor', 'black'), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'red'),\n"
" ('pendown', True), ('pensize', 10), ('resizemode', 'noresize'),\n"
" ('shearfactor', 0.0), ('shown', True), ('speed', 9),\n"
" ('stretchfactor', (1.0, 1.0)), ('tilt', 0.0)]\n"
">>> penstate=turtle.pen()\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"yellow\", \"\")\n"
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())[:3]\n"
"[('fillcolor', ''), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'yellow')]\n"
">>> turtle.pen(penstate, fillcolor=\"green\")\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())[:3]\n"
"[('fillcolor', 'green'), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'red')]"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pen(fillcolor=\"black\", pencolor=\"red\", pensize=10)\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())\n"
"[('fillcolor', 'black'), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'red'),\n"
" ('pendown', True), ('pensize', 10), ('resizemode', 'noresize'),\n"
" ('shearfactor', 0.0), ('shown', True), ('speed', 9),\n"
" ('stretchfactor', (1.0, 1.0)), ('tilt', 0.0)]\n"
">>> penstate=turtle.pen()\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"yellow\", \"\")\n"
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())[:3]\n"
"[('fillcolor', ''), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'yellow')]\n"
">>> turtle.pen(penstate, fillcolor=\"green\")\n"
">>> sorted(turtle.pen().items())[:3]\n"
"[('fillcolor', 'green'), ('outline', 1), ('pencolor', 'red')]"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:892
msgid "Return ``True`` if pen is down, ``False`` if it's up."
msgstr ""
"もしペンが下りていれば ``True`` を、上がっていれば ``False`` を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.pendown()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.pendown()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"True"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:906
msgid "Color control"
msgstr "色の制御"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:912
msgid "Return or set the pencolor."
msgstr "ペンの色(pencolor)を設定するかまたは返します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:914 ../../library/turtle.rst:966
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1639
msgid "Four input formats are allowed:"
msgstr "4種類の入力形式が受け入れ可能です:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:916
msgid "``pencolor()``"
msgstr "``pencolor()``"

msgid ""
"Return the current pencolor as color specification string or as a tuple (see "
"example).  May be used as input to another :func:`color`, :func:`pencolor`, :"
"func:`fillcolor` or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"現在のペンの色を、色指定文字列またはタプルとして返します (例を参照)。\n"
"この値は :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor`、:func:`bgcolor` "
"の呼び出しに渡せます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:922
msgid "``pencolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``pencolor(colorstring)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:923
msgid ""
"Set pencolor to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification string, "
"such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"ペンの色を *colorstring* に設定します。その値は Tk の色指定文字列で、 "
"``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, ``\"#33cc8c\"`` のような文字列です。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:926
msgid "``pencolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``pencolor((r, g, b))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:927
msgid ""
"Set pencolor to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, *g*, and "
"*b*.  Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be in the range 0..colormode, where "
"colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"ペンの色を *r*, *g*, *b* のタプルで表された RGB の色に設定します。各 *r*, "
"*g*, *b* は 0 から colormode の間の値でなければなりません。ここで colormode "
"は 1.0 か 255 のどちらかです (:func:`colormode` を参照)。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:931
msgid "``pencolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``pencolor(r, g, b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:932
msgid ""
"Set pencolor to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*.  Each of "
"*r*, *g*, and *b* must be in the range 0..colormode."
msgstr ""
"ペンの色を *r*, *g*, *b* で表された RGB の色に設定します。各 *r*, *g*, *b* "
"は 0 から colormode の間の値でなければなりません。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:935
msgid ""
"If turtleshape is a polygon, the outline of that polygon is drawn with the "
"newly set pencolor."
msgstr ""
"タートルの形(turtleshape)が多角形の場合、多角形の外側が新しく設定された色で描"
"かれます。"

msgid ""
">>> colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(\"brown\")\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'brown'\n"
">>> tup = (0.2, 0.8, 0.55)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(tup)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(0.2, 0.8, 0.5490196078431373)\n"
">>> colormode(255)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(51.0, 204.0, 140.0)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor('#32c18f')\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(\"brown\")\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'brown'\n"
">>> tup = (0.2, 0.8, 0.55)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(tup)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(0.2, 0.8, 0.5490196078431373)\n"
">>> colormode(255)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(51.0, 204.0, 140.0)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor('#32c18f')\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:964
msgid "Return or set the fillcolor."
msgstr "塗りつぶしの色(fillcolor)を設定するかまたは返します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:968
msgid "``fillcolor()``"
msgstr "``fillcolor()``"

msgid ""
"Return the current fillcolor as color specification string, possibly in "
"tuple format (see example).  May be used as input to another :func:`color`, :"
"func:`pencolor`, :func:`fillcolor` or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"現在の塗りつぶしの色を、色指定文字列またはタプルとして返します (例を参照)。\n"
"この値は :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor`、:func:`bgcolor` "
"の呼び出しに渡せます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:974
msgid "``fillcolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``fillcolor(colorstring)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:975
msgid ""
"Set fillcolor to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification string, "
"such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"塗りつぶしの色を *colorstring* に設定します。その値は Tk の色指定文字列で、 "
"``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, ``\"#33cc8c\"`` のような文字列です。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:978
msgid "``fillcolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``fillcolor((r, g, b))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:979
msgid ""
"Set fillcolor to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, *g*, and "
"*b*.  Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be in the range 0..colormode, where "
"colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"塗りつぶしの色を *r*, *g*, *b* のタプルで表された RGB の色に設定します。各 "
"*r*, *g*, *b* は 0 から colormode の間の値でなければなりません。ここで "
"colormode は 1.0 か 255 のどちらかです (:func:`colormode` を参照)。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:983
msgid "``fillcolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``fillcolor(r, g, b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:984
msgid ""
"Set fillcolor to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*.  Each of "
"*r*, *g*, and *b* must be in the range 0..colormode."
msgstr ""
"塗りつぶしの色を *r*, *g*, *b* で表された RGB の色に設定します。各 *r*, *g*, "
"*b* は 0 から colormode の間の値でなければなりません。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:987
msgid ""
"If turtleshape is a polygon, the interior of that polygon is drawn with the "
"newly set fillcolor."
msgstr ""
"タートルの形(turtleshape)が多角形の場合、多角形の内側が新しく設定された色で描"
"かれます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.fillcolor(\"violet\")\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"'violet'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor((50, 193, 143))  # Integers, not floats\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor('#ffffff')\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(255.0, 255.0, 255.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.fillcolor(\"violet\")\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"'violet'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor((50, 193, 143))  # 浮動小数点数ではなく整数\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor('#ffffff')\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(255.0, 255.0, 255.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1011
msgid "Return or set pencolor and fillcolor."
msgstr ""
"ペンの色(pencolor)と塗りつぶしの色(fillcolor)を設定するかまたは返します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1013
msgid ""
"Several input formats are allowed.  They use 0 to 3 arguments as follows:"
msgstr ""
"いくつかの入力形式が受け入れ可能です。形式ごとに 0 から 3 個の引数を以下のよ"
"うに使います:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1016
msgid "``color()``"
msgstr "``color()``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1017
msgid ""
"Return the current pencolor and the current fillcolor as a pair of color "
"specification strings or tuples as returned by :func:`pencolor` and :func:"
"`fillcolor`."
msgstr ""
"現在のペンの色と塗りつぶしの色を :func:`pencolor` および :func:`fillcolor` で"
"返される色指定文字列またはタプルのペアで返します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1021
msgid "``color(colorstring)``, ``color((r,g,b))``, ``color(r,g,b)``"
msgstr "``color(colorstring)``, ``color((r,g,b))``, ``color(r,g,b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1022
msgid ""
"Inputs as in :func:`pencolor`, set both, fillcolor and pencolor, to the "
"given value."
msgstr ""
":func:`pencolor` の入力と同じですが、塗りつぶしの色とペンの色、両方を与えられ"
"た値に設定します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1025
msgid ""
"``color(colorstring1, colorstring2)``, ``color((r1,g1,b1), (r2,g2,b2))``"
msgstr ""
"``color(colorstring1, colorstring2)``, ``color((r1,g1,b1), (r2,g2,b2))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1026
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``pencolor(colorstring1)`` and ``fillcolor(colorstring2)`` and "
"analogously if the other input format is used."
msgstr ""
"``pencolor(colorstring1)`` および ``fillcolor(colorstring2)`` を呼び出すのと"
"等価です。もう一つの入力形式についても同様です。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1029
msgid ""
"If turtleshape is a polygon, outline and interior of that polygon is drawn "
"with the newly set colors."
msgstr ""
"タートルの形(turtleshape)が多角形の場合、多角形の内側も外側も新しく設定された"
"色で描かれます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"red\", \"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.color()\n"
"('red', 'green')\n"
">>> color(\"#285078\", \"#a0c8f0\")\n"
">>> color()\n"
"((40.0, 80.0, 120.0), (160.0, 200.0, 240.0))"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"red\", \"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.color()\n"
"('red', 'green')\n"
">>> color(\"#285078\", \"#a0c8f0\")\n"
">>> color()\n"
"((40.0, 80.0, 120.0), (160.0, 200.0, 240.0))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1043
msgid "See also: Screen method :func:`colormode`."
msgstr "こちらも参照: スクリーンのメソッド :func:`colormode` 。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1047
msgid "Filling"
msgstr "塗りつぶし"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1057
msgid "Return fillstate (``True`` if filling, ``False`` else)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> if turtle.filling():\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(5)\n"
"... else:\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(3)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> if turtle.filling():\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(5)\n"
"... else:\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(3)"

msgid "Fill the shape drawn in the ``with turtle.fill():`` block."
msgstr "``with turtle.fill():`` ブロック内で描いた図形を塗りつぶします。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> with turtle.fill():\n"
"...     turtle.circle(80)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> with turtle.fill():\n"
"...     turtle.circle(80)"

msgid ""
"Using :func:`!fill` is equivalent to adding the :func:`begin_fill` before "
"the fill-block and :func:`end_fill` after the fill-block:"
msgstr ""
":func:`!fill` を使うことは、塗りつぶしのブロックの前に :func:`begin_fill`、後"
"に :func:`end_fill` を追加するのと同等です。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> turtle.circle(80)\n"
">>> turtle.end_fill()"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> turtle.circle(80)\n"
">>> turtle.end_fill()"

msgid "To be called just before drawing a shape to be filled."
msgstr "塗りつぶす図形を描く直前に呼び出します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1100
msgid "Fill the shape drawn after the last call to :func:`begin_fill`."
msgstr ""
"最後に呼び出された :func:`begin_fill` の後に描かれた図形を塗りつぶします。"

msgid ""
"Whether or not overlap regions for self-intersecting polygons or multiple "
"shapes are filled depends on the operating system graphics, type of overlap, "
"and number of overlaps.  For example, the Turtle star above may be either "
"all yellow or have some white regions."
msgstr ""
"自己交差する多角形や複数の図形で、重なった領域が塗りつぶされるかどうかは、オ"
"ペレーティングシステムの描画機能や重なり方、重なった回数によって変わりま"
"す。\n"
"例えば、上のタートルで描いた星形は、全体が黄色になる場合もあれば、白い領域が"
"残る場合もあります。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1117
msgid "More drawing control"
msgstr "さらなる描画の制御"

msgid ""
"Delete the turtle's drawings and re-center the turtle. The turtle's settings "
"are restored to their default values."
msgstr ""
"タートルが描いたものを消し、タートルを中央に戻します。\n"
"タートルの設定はデフォルト値に戻ります。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.goto(0,-22)\n"
">>> turtle.left(100)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-22.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.goto(0,-22)\n"
">>> turtle.left(100)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-22.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

msgid ""
"Delete the turtle's drawings from the screen. The state and position of the "
"turtle as well as the drawings of other turtles are not affected."
msgstr ""
"タートルが描いたものを画面から消します。\n"
"タートルの状態と位置、他のタートルが描いたものには影響しません。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1148
msgid "object to be written to the TurtleScreen"
msgstr "TurtleScreen に書かれるオブジェクト"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1149
msgid "True/False"
msgstr "True/False"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1150
msgid "one of the strings \"left\", \"center\" or right\""
msgstr "文字列 \"left\", \"center\", right\" のどれか"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1151
msgid "a triple (fontname, fontsize, fonttype)"
msgstr "三つ組み (fontname, fontsize, fonttype)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1153
msgid ""
"Write text - the string representation of *arg* - at the current turtle "
"position according to *align* (\"left\", \"center\" or \"right\") and with "
"the given font.  If *move* is true, the pen is moved to the bottom-right "
"corner of the text.  By default, *move* is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"文字を書きます— *arg* の文字列表現を、現在のタートルの位置に、 *align* "
"(\"left\", \"center\", \"right\" のどれか) に従って、 与えられたフォントで。 "
"もし *move* が真ならば、ペンは書いた文の右下隅に移動します。 デフォルトで"
"は、 *move* は ``False`` です。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.write(\"Home = \", True, align=\"center\")\n"
">>> turtle.write((0,0), True)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.write(\"Home = \", True, align=\"center\")\n"
">>> turtle.write((0,0), True)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1166
msgid "Turtle state"
msgstr "タートルの状態"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1169
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "可視性"

msgid "Make the turtle invisible. If the pen is down, movement still draws."
msgstr ""
"タートルを見えなくします。\n"
"ペンが下りていれば、移動すると引き続き線を描きます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1180
msgid "Make the turtle visible."
msgstr "タートルが見えるようにします。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1185
msgid "Return ``True`` if the turtle is shown, ``False`` if it's hidden."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
">>> turtle.hideturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.showturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.hideturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.showturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"True"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1199
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "見た目"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1203
msgid "a string which is a valid shapename"
msgstr "形の名前(shapename)として正しい文字列"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1205
msgid ""
"Set turtle shape to shape with given *name* or, if name is not given, return "
"name of current shape.  Shape with *name* must exist in the TurtleScreen's "
"shape dictionary.  Initially there are the following polygon shapes: "
"\"arrow\", \"turtle\", \"circle\", \"square\", \"triangle\", \"classic\".  "
"To learn about how to deal with shapes see Screen method :func:"
"`register_shape`."
msgstr ""
"タートルの形を与えられた名前(*name*)の形に設定するか、もしくは名前が与えられ"
"なければ現在の形の名前を返します。 *name* という名前の形は TurtleScreen の形"
"の辞書に載っていなければなりません。最初は次の多角形が載っています: "
"\"arrow\", \"turtle\", \"circle\", \"square\", \"triangle\", \"classic\"。形"
"についての扱いを学ぶには Screen のメソッド :func:`register_shape` を参照して"
"下さい。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'classic'\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"turtle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'turtle'"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'classic'\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"turtle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'turtle'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1223
msgid "one of the strings \"auto\", \"user\", \"noresize\""
msgstr "文字列 \"auto\", \"user\", \"noresize\" のどれか"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1225
msgid ""
"Set resizemode to one of the values: \"auto\", \"user\", \"noresize\".  If "
"*rmode* is not given, return current resizemode.  Different resizemodes have "
"the following effects:"
msgstr ""
"サイズ変更のモード(resizemode)を \"auto\", \"user\", \"noresize\" のどれかに"
"設定します。もし *rmode* が与えられなければ、現在のサイズ変更モードを返しま"
"す。それぞれのサイズ変更モードは以下の効果を持ちます:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1229
msgid ""
"\"auto\": adapts the appearance of the turtle corresponding to the value of "
"pensize."
msgstr "\"auto\": ペンのサイズに対応してタートルの見た目を調整します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1230
msgid ""
"\"user\": adapts the appearance of the turtle according to the values of "
"stretchfactor and outlinewidth (outline), which are set by :func:`shapesize`."
msgstr ""
"\"user\": 伸長係数(stretchfactor)およびアウトライン幅(outlinewidth)の値に対応"
"してタートルの見た目を調整します。これらの値は :func:`shapesize` で設定しま"
"す。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1233
msgid "\"noresize\": no adaption of the turtle's appearance takes place."
msgstr "\"noresize\": タートルの見た目を調整しません。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1235
msgid ""
"``resizemode(\"user\")`` is called by :func:`shapesize` when used with "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"``resizemode(\"user\")`` は :func:`shapesize` に引数を渡したときに呼び出され"
"ます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'noresize'\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"auto\")\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'auto'"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'noresize'\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"auto\")\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'auto'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1250 ../../library/turtle.rst:1251
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1252
msgid "positive number"
msgstr "正の数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1254
msgid ""
"Return or set the pen's attributes x/y-stretchfactors and/or outline.  Set "
"resizemode to \"user\".  If and only if resizemode is set to \"user\", the "
"turtle will be displayed stretched according to its stretchfactors: "
"*stretch_wid* is stretchfactor perpendicular to its orientation, "
"*stretch_len* is stretchfactor in direction of its orientation, *outline* "
"determines the width of the shape's outline."
msgstr ""
"ペンの属性 x/y-伸長係数および/またはアウトラインを返すかまたは設定します。サ"
"イズ変更のモードは \"user\" に設定されます。サイズ変更のモードが \"user\" に"
"設定されたときかつそのときに限り、タートルは伸長係数(stretchfactor)に従って伸"
"長されて表示されます。 *stretch_wid* は進行方向に直交する向きの伸長係数で、 "
"*stretch_len* は進行方向に沿ったの伸長係数、 *outline* は形のアウトラインの幅"
"を決めるものです。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(1.0, 1.0, 1)\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"user\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(outline=8)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 8)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(1.0, 1.0, 1)\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"user\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(outline=8)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 8)"

msgid "number (optional)"
msgstr "数 (省略可能)"

msgid ""
"Set or return the current shearfactor. Shear the turtleshape according to "
"the given shearfactor shear, which is the tangent of the shear angle. Do "
"*not* change the turtle's heading (direction of movement). If shear is not "
"given: return the current shearfactor, i. e. the tangent of the shear angle, "
"by which lines parallel to the heading of the turtle are sheared."
msgstr ""
"現在のせん断係数を設定または取得します。\n"
"せん断角の正接である係数 ``shear`` に従って、タートルの形状をせん断変形しま"
"す。\n"
"タートルの向き (進行方向) は *変わりません*。\n"
"``shear`` を指定しなければ、現在のせん断係数、つまりタートルの進行方向に平行"
"な線のせん断角の正接を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor()\n"
"0.5"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor()\n"
"0.5"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1300
msgid ""
"Rotate the turtleshape by *angle* from its current tilt-angle, but do *not* "
"change the turtle's heading (direction of movement)."
msgstr ""
"タートルの形(turtleshape)を現在の傾斜角から角度(*angle*)だけ回転します。この"
"ときタートルの進む方向は *変わりません* 。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"

msgid "a number (optional)"
msgstr "数 (省略可能)"

msgid ""
"Set or return the current tilt-angle. If angle is given, rotate the "
"turtleshape to point in the direction specified by angle, regardless of its "
"current tilt-angle. Do *not* change the turtle's heading (direction of "
"movement). If angle is not given: return the current tilt-angle, i. e. the "
"angle between the orientation of the turtleshape and the heading of the "
"turtle (its direction of movement)."
msgstr ""
"現在の傾斜角を設定または取得します。\n"
"``angle`` を指定すると、現在の傾斜角にかかわらず、タートルの形状を ``angle`` "
"の方向に回転させます。\n"
"タートルの向き (進行方向) は *変わりません*。\n"
"``angle`` を指定しなければ、現在の傾斜角、つまりタートルの形状の向きと進行方"
"向との間の角度を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(45)\n"
">>> turtle.tiltangle()\n"
"45.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(45)\n"
">>> turtle.tiltangle()\n"
"45.0"

msgid "Set or return the current transformation matrix of the turtle shape."
msgstr "タートルの形状の現在の変換行列を設定または取得します。"

msgid ""
"If none of the matrix elements are given, return the transformation matrix "
"as a tuple of 4 elements. Otherwise set the given elements and transform the "
"turtleshape according to the matrix consisting of first row t11, t12 and "
"second row t21, t22. The determinant t11 * t22 - t12 * t21 must not be zero, "
"otherwise an error is raised. Modify stretchfactor, shearfactor and "
"tiltangle according to the given matrix."
msgstr ""
"行列の要素を何も指定しなければ、変換行列を 4 要素のタプルとして返します。\n"
"指定した場合はその要素を設定し、第 1 行が ``t11``、``t12``、第 2 行が "
"``t21``、``t22`` の行列に従ってタートルの形状を変換します。\n"
"行列式 ``t11 * t22 - t12 * t21`` は 0 であってはならず、0 の場合はエラーを送"
"出します。\n"
"指定された行列に応じて、伸縮率、せん断係数、傾斜角を変更します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle = Turtle()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(4,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(-0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform()\n"
"(4.0, -1.0, -0.0, 2.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle = Turtle()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(4,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(-0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform()\n"
"(4.0, -1.0, -0.0, 2.0)"

msgid ""
"Return the current shape polygon as tuple of coordinate pairs. This can be "
"used to define a new shape or components of a compound shape."
msgstr ""
"現在の形状の多角形を、座標ペアのタプルとして返します。\n"
"新しい形状や、複合形状の構成要素を定義するために使えます。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform(4, -1, 0, 2)\n"
">>> turtle.get_shapepoly()\n"
"((50, -20), (30, 20), (-50, 20), (-30, -20))"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform(4, -1, 0, 2)\n"
">>> turtle.get_shapepoly()\n"
"((50, -20), (30, 20), (-50, 20), (-30, -20))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1382
msgid "Using events"
msgstr "イベントを利用する"

msgid "a function with two arguments or ``None``"
msgstr "2 つの引数を取る関数、または ``None``"

msgid "an integer"
msgstr "整数"

msgid "a boolean or ``None``"
msgstr "ブール値または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-click events on this turtle. *fun* is called with the "
"coordinates of the clicked point on the canvas. If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the number of the mouse button and "
"defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If *add* is ``True``, a new binding is "
"added, otherwise it replaces a former binding. Example for the anonymous "
"turtle, that is, the procedural way:"
msgstr ""
"このタートル上のマウスクリックイベントに *fun* を束縛します。\n"
"*fun* は、クリックされた点のキャンバス上の座標を引数として呼び出されます。\n"
"*fun* が ``None`` の場合は、既存の束縛を削除します。\n"
"*btn* はマウスボタンの番号で、デフォルトは左ボタンを表す 1 です。\n"
"*add* が ``True`` の場合は新しい束縛を追加し、それ以外の場合は以前の束縛を置"
"き換えます。\n"
"以下は、無名のタートルを使う、つまり手続き的な書き方の例です。"

msgid ""
">>> def turn(x, y):\n"
"...     left(180)\n"
"...\n"
">>> onclick(turn)  # Now clicking into the turtle will turn it.\n"
">>> onclick(None)  # event-binding will be removed"
msgstr ""
">>> def turn(x, y):\n"
"...     left(180)\n"
"...\n"
">>> onclick(turn)  # タートルをクリックすると向きが変わる\n"
">>> onclick(None)  # イベントの束縛を削除する"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1410 ../../library/turtle.rst:1435
msgid ""
"a function with two arguments which will be called with the coordinates of "
"the clicked point on the canvas"
msgstr ""
"2引数の関数でキャンバスのクリックされた点の座標を引数として呼び出されるもので"
"す"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1412 ../../library/turtle.rst:1437
msgid "number of the mouse-button, defaults to 1 (left mouse button)"
msgstr "マウスボタンの番号、デフォルトは 1 (左マウスボタン)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1413 ../../library/turtle.rst:1438
msgid ""
"``True`` or ``False`` -- if ``True``, a new binding will be added, otherwise "
"it will replace a former binding"
msgstr ""
"``True`` または ``False`` -- ``True`` ならば、 新しい束縛が追加されますが、そ"
"うでなければ、 以前の束縛を置き換えます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1416
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-button-release events on this turtle.  If *fun* is "
"``None``, existing bindings are removed."
msgstr ""
"*fun* をタートルのマウスボタンリリース(mouse-button-release)イベントに束縛し"
"ます。 *fun* が ``None`` ならば、既存の束縛が取り除かれます。"

msgid ""
">>> class MyTurtle(Turtle):\n"
"...     def glow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"red\")\n"
"...     def unglow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"\")\n"
"...\n"
">>> turtle = MyTurtle()\n"
">>> turtle.onclick(turtle.glow)     # clicking on turtle turns fillcolor "
"red,\n"
">>> turtle.onrelease(turtle.unglow) # releasing turns it to transparent."
msgstr ""
">>> class MyTurtle(Turtle):\n"
"...     def glow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"red\")\n"
"...     def unglow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"\")\n"
"...\n"
">>> turtle = MyTurtle()\n"
">>> turtle.onclick(turtle.glow)     # タートルをクリックすると塗りつぶしの色"
"が赤になり、\n"
">>> turtle.onrelease(turtle.unglow) # ボタンを離すと透明になる"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1441
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-move events on this turtle.  If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed."
msgstr ""
"*fun* をタートルのマウスムーブ(mouse-move)イベントに束縛します。 *fun* が "
"``None`` ならば、既存の束縛が取り除かれます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1444
msgid ""
"Remark: Every sequence of mouse-move-events on a turtle is preceded by a "
"mouse-click event on that turtle."
msgstr ""
"注意: 全てのマウスムーブイベントのシーケンスに先立ってマウスクリックイベント"
"が起こります。"

msgid ">>> turtle.ondrag(turtle.goto)"
msgstr ">>> turtle.ondrag(turtle.goto)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1452
msgid ""
"Subsequently, clicking and dragging the Turtle will move it across the "
"screen thereby producing handdrawings (if pen is down)."
msgstr ""
"この後、タートルをクリックしてドラッグするとタートルはスクリーン上を動きそれ"
"によって(ペンが下りていれば)手書きの線ができあがります。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1457
msgid "Special Turtle methods"
msgstr "特別な Turtle のメソッド"

msgid ""
"Record the vertices of a polygon drawn in the ``with turtle.poly():`` block. "
"The first and last vertices will be connected."
msgstr ""
"``with turtle.poly():`` ブロック内で描いた多角形の頂点を記録します。\n"
"最初と最後の頂点は結ばれます。"

msgid ""
">>> with turtle.poly():\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)\n"
"...     turtle.right(60)\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)"
msgstr ""
">>> with turtle.poly():\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)\n"
"...     turtle.right(60)\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)"

msgid ""
"Start recording the vertices of a polygon. The current turtle position is "
"the first vertex of the polygon."
msgstr ""
"多角形の頂点の記録を開始します。\n"
"タートルの現在の位置が、多角形の最初の頂点になります。"

msgid ""
"Stop recording the vertices of a polygon. The current turtle position is the "
"last vertex of the polygon. This will be connected with the first vertex."
msgstr ""
"多角形の頂点の記録を停止します。\n"
"タートルの現在の位置が最後の頂点となり、最初の頂点と結ばれます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1490
msgid "Return the last recorded polygon."
msgstr "最後に記録された多角形を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(100)\n"
">>> turtle.left(20)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()\n"
">>> p = turtle.get_poly()\n"
">>> register_shape(\"myFavouriteShape\", p)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(100)\n"
">>> turtle.left(20)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()\n"
">>> p = turtle.get_poly()\n"
">>> register_shape(\"myFavouriteShape\", p)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1509
msgid ""
"Create and return a clone of the turtle with same position, heading and "
"turtle properties."
msgstr ""
"位置、向きその他のプロパティがそっくり同じタートルのクローンを作って返しま"
"す。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1512
msgid ""
">>> mick = Turtle()\n"
">>> joe = mick.clone()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1522
msgid ""
"Return the Turtle object itself.  Only reasonable use: as a function to "
"return the \"anonymous turtle\":"
msgstr ""
"Turtle オブジェクトそのものを返します。唯一の意味のある使い方: 無名タートルを"
"返す関数として使う:"

msgid ""
">>> pet = getturtle()\n"
">>> pet.fd(50)\n"
">>> pet\n"
"<turtle.Turtle object at 0x...>"
msgstr ""
">>> pet = getturtle()\n"
">>> pet.fd(50)\n"
">>> pet\n"
"<turtle.Turtle object at 0x...>"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1536
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`TurtleScreen` object the turtle is drawing on. "
"TurtleScreen methods can then be called for that object."
msgstr ""
"タートルが描画中の :class:`TurtleScreen` オブジェクトを返します。 "
"TurtleScreen のメソッドをそのオブジェクトに対して呼び出すことができます。"

msgid ""
">>> ts = turtle.getscreen()\n"
">>> ts\n"
"<turtle._Screen object at 0x...>\n"
">>> ts.bgcolor(\"pink\")"
msgstr ""
">>> ts = turtle.getscreen()\n"
">>> ts\n"
"<turtle._Screen object at 0x...>\n"
">>> ts.bgcolor(\"pink\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1552
msgid ""
"Set or disable undobuffer.  If *size* is an integer, an empty undobuffer of "
"given size is installed.  *size* gives the maximum number of turtle actions "
"that can be undone by the :func:`undo` method/function.  If *size* is "
"``None``, the undobuffer is disabled."
msgstr ""
"アンドゥバッファを設定または無効化します。 *size* が整数ならばそのサイズの空"
"のアンドゥバッファを用意します。 *size* の値はタートルのアクションを何度 :"
"func:`undo` メソッド/関数で取り消せるかの最大数を与えます。 *size* が "
"``None`` ならば、アンドゥバッファは無効化されます。"

msgid ">>> turtle.setundobuffer(42)"
msgstr ">>> turtle.setundobuffer(42)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1565
msgid "Return number of entries in the undobuffer."
msgstr "アンドゥバッファのエントリー数を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> while undobufferentries():\n"
"...     undo()"
msgstr ""
">>> while undobufferentries():\n"
"...     undo()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1578
msgid "Compound shapes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1580
msgid ""
"To use compound turtle shapes, which consist of several polygons of "
"different color, you must use the helper class :class:`Shape` explicitly as "
"described below:"
msgstr ""
"合成されたタートルの形、つまり幾つかの色の違う多角形から成るような形を使うに"
"は、以下のように補助クラス :class:`Shape` を直接使わなければなりません:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1584
msgid "Create an empty Shape object of type \"compound\"."
msgstr "タイプ \"compound\" の空の Shape オブジェクトを作ります。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1585
msgid ""
"Add as many components to this object as desired, using the :meth:`~Shape."
"addcomponent` method."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~Shape.addcomponent` メソッドを使って、好きなだけここにコンポーネント"
"を追加します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1588
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例えば:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1590
msgid ""
">>> s = Shape(\"compound\")\n"
">>> poly1 = ((0,0),(10,-5),(0,10),(-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly1, \"red\", \"blue\")\n"
">>> poly2 = ((0,0),(10,-5),(-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly2, \"blue\", \"red\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1599
msgid "Now add the Shape to the Screen's shapelist and use it:"
msgstr ""
"こうして作った Shape を Screen の形のリスト(shapelist) に追加して使います:"

msgid ""
">>> register_shape(\"myshape\", s)\n"
">>> shape(\"myshape\")"
msgstr ""
">>> register_shape(\"myshape\", s)\n"
">>> shape(\"myshape\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1610
msgid ""
"The :class:`Shape` class is used internally by the :func:`register_shape` "
"method in different ways.  The application programmer has to deal with the "
"Shape class *only* when using compound shapes like shown above!"
msgstr ""
":class:`Shape` クラスは :func:`register_shape` の内部では違った使われ方をしま"
"す。アプリケーションを書く人が Shape クラスを扱わなければならないのは、上で示"
"したように合成された形を使うとき *だけ* です！"

msgid "Screen methods and functions"
msgstr "Screen のメソッドと関数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1621
msgid ""
"Most of the examples in this section refer to a TurtleScreen instance called "
"``screen``."
msgstr ""
"この節のほとんどの例では ``screen`` という名前の TurtleScreen インスタンスを"
"使います。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1631
msgid "Window control"
msgstr "ウィンドウの制御"

msgid "Return or set the background color of the TurtleScreen."
msgstr "TurtleScreen の背景色を取得または設定します。"

msgid "``bgcolor()``"
msgstr "``bgcolor()``"

msgid ""
"Return the current background color as a color specification string or as a "
"tuple (see example).  May be used as input to another :func:`color`, :func:"
"`pencolor`, :func:`fillcolor` or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"現在の背景色を、色指定文字列またはタプルとして返します (例を参照)。\n"
"この値は :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor`、:func:`bgcolor` "
"の呼び出しに渡せます。"

msgid "``bgcolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``bgcolor(colorstring)``"

msgid ""
"Set the background color to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification "
"string, such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"背景色を *colorstring* に設定します。\n"
"*colorstring* は、``\"red\"``、``\"yellow\"``、``\"#33cc8c\"`` などの Tk の色"
"指定文字列です。"

msgid "``bgcolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``bgcolor((r, g, b))``"

msgid ""
"Set the background color to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, "
"*g*, and *b*. Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode, "
"where colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"背景色を、*r*、*g*、*b* のタプルで表す RGB の色に設定します。\n"
"*r*、*g*、*b* はそれぞれ 0 から colormode までの値でなければなりません。\n"
"colormode は 1.0 または 255 です (:func:`colormode` を参照)。"

msgid "``bgcolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``bgcolor(r, g, b)``"

msgid ""
"Set the background color to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*. "
"Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode."
msgstr ""
"背景色を、*r*、*g*、*b* で表す RGB の色に設定します。\n"
"*r*、*g*、*b* はそれぞれ 0 から colormode までの値でなければなりません。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"'orange'\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"#800080\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"(128.0, 0.0, 128.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"'orange'\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"#800080\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"(128.0, 0.0, 128.0)"

msgid ""
"a string, name of an image file (PNG, GIF, PGM, and PPM) or ``\"nopic\"``, "
"or ``None``"
msgstr ""
"画像ファイル (PNG、GIF、PGM、PPM) の名前を表す文字列、``\"nopic\"``、または "
"``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1677
msgid ""
"Set background image or return name of current backgroundimage.  If "
"*picname* is a filename, set the corresponding image as background.  If "
"*picname* is ``\"nopic\"``, delete background image, if present.  If "
"*picname* is ``None``, return the filename of the current backgroundimage. ::"
msgstr ""
"背景の画像を設定するかまたは現在の背景画像(backgroundimage)の名前を返しま"
"す。 *picname* がファイル名ならば、その画像を背景に設定します。 *picname* が "
"``\"nopic\"`` ならば、(もしあれば)背景画像を削除します。 *picname* が "
"``None`` ならば、現在の背景画像のファイル名を返します。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1682
msgid ""
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"'nopic'\n"
">>> screen.bgpic(\"landscape.gif\")\n"
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"\"landscape.gif\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1693
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``clearscreen``.  The global function ``clear`` is a different one "
"derived from the Turtle method ``clear``."
msgstr ""
"この TurtleScreen メソッドはグローバル関数としては ``clearscreen`` という名前"
"でだけ使えます。グローバル関数 ``clear`` は Turtle メソッドの ``clear`` から"
"派生した別ものです。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1700
msgid ""
"Delete all drawings and all turtles from the TurtleScreen.  Reset the now "
"empty TurtleScreen to its initial state: white background, no background "
"image, no event bindings and tracing on."
msgstr ""
"全ての図形と全てのタートルを TurtleScreen から削除します。そして空になった "
"TurtleScreen をリセットして初期状態に戻します: 白い背景、背景画像もイベント束"
"縛もなく、トレーシングはオンです。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1709
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``resetscreen``.  The global function ``reset`` is another one derived "
"from the Turtle method ``reset``."
msgstr ""
"この TurtleScreen メソッドはグローバル関数としては ``resetscreen`` という名前"
"でだけ使えます。グローバル関数 ``reset`` は Turtle メソッドの ``reset`` から"
"派生した別ものです。"

msgid "Reset all turtles on the screen to their initial state."
msgstr "画面上のすべてのタートルを初期状態に戻します。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1721
msgid "positive integer, new width of canvas in pixels"
msgstr "正の整数でピクセル単位の新しいキャンバス幅(canvaswidth)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1722
msgid "positive integer, new height of canvas in pixels"
msgstr "正の整数でピクセル単位の新しいキャンバス高さ(canvasheight)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1723
msgid "colorstring or color-tuple, new background color"
msgstr "色文字列または色タプルで新しい背景色"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1725
msgid ""
"If no arguments are given, return current (canvaswidth, canvasheight).  Else "
"resize the canvas the turtles are drawing on.  Do not alter the drawing "
"window.  To observe hidden parts of the canvas, use the scrollbars. With "
"this method, one can make visible those parts of a drawing which were "
"outside the canvas before."
msgstr ""
"引数が渡されなければ、現在の (キャンバス幅, キャンバス高さ) を返します。そう"
"でなければタートルが描画するキャンバスのサイズを変更します。描画ウィンドウに"
"は影響しません。キャンバスの隠れた部分を見るためにはスクロールバーを使って下"
"さい。このメソッドを使うと、以前はキャンバスの外にあったそうした図形の一部を"
"見えるようにすることができます。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(400, 300)\n"
">>> screen.screensize(2000,1500)\n"
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(2000, 1500)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(400, 300)\n"
">>> screen.screensize(2000,1500)\n"
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(2000, 1500)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1740
msgid "e.g. to search for an erroneously escaped turtle ;-)"
msgstr "# 逃げ出してしまったタートルを探すためとかね ;-)"

msgid ""
"Set up a user-defined coordinate system. *llx* and *lly* are the x and y "
"coordinates of the lower left corner of the canvas. *urx* and *ury* are the "
"x and y coordinates of the upper right corner. Switch to mode \"world\" if "
"necessary, which performs a reset. If mode \"world\" is already active, all "
"drawings are redrawn according to the new coordinates. In user-defined "
"coordinate systems, angles may appear distorted, see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"ユーザー定義の座標系を設定します。\n"
"*llx* と *lly* はキャンバスの左下隅の x 座標と y 座標、*urx* と *ury* は右上"
"隅の x 座標と y 座標です。\n"
"必要に応じて \"world\" モードに切り替え、その際にリセットします。\n"
"すでに \"world\" モードであれば、新しい座標に従ってすべての図形を描き直しま"
"す。\n"
"ユーザー定義の座標系では、角度が歪んで見えることがあります。\n"
":func:`mode` を参照してください。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.reset()\n"
">>> screen.setworldcoordinates(-50,-7.5,50,7.5)\n"
">>> for _ in range(72):\n"
"...     left(10)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for _ in range(8):\n"
"...     left(45); fd(2)   # a regular octagon"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.reset()\n"
">>> screen.setworldcoordinates(-50,-7.5,50,7.5)\n"
">>> for _ in range(72):\n"
"...     left(10)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for _ in range(8):\n"
"...     left(45); fd(2)   # 正八角形"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1778
msgid "Animation control"
msgstr "アニメーションの制御"

msgid ""
"Temporarily turn off turtle animation. The code inside the :keyword:`with` "
"block is not animated. Once the block is exited, the drawing appears. This "
"is useful for drawing complex shapes where even the fastest speed setting is "
"too slow."
msgstr ""
"タートルのアニメーションを一時的に無効にします。\n"
":keyword:`with` ブロック内のコードではアニメーションを行わず、ブロックを出る"
"と描画結果が表示されます。\n"
"最速の設定でも遅すぎる複雑な図形を描くときに便利です。"

msgid ""
">>> with screen.no_animation():\n"
"...     for dist in range(2, 400, 2):\n"
"...         fd(dist)\n"
"...         rt(90)"
msgstr ""
">>> with screen.no_animation():\n"
"...     for dist in range(2, 400, 2):\n"
"...         fd(dist)\n"
"...         rt(90)"

msgid "a nonnegative integer or ``None``"
msgstr "非負の整数または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Return or set the drawing delay in milliseconds. This is approximately the "
"time interval between two consecutive canvas updates. The longer the drawing "
"delay, the slower the animation."
msgstr ""
"描画の遅延時間をミリ秒単位で取得または設定します。\n"
"これは、連続するキャンバスの更新の間のおおよその時間です。\n"
"遅延時間が長いほど、アニメーションは遅くなります。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"10\n"
">>> screen.delay(5)\n"
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"5"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"10\n"
">>> screen.delay(5)\n"
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"5"

msgid ""
"Turn turtle animation on or off and set the drawing delay. If *n* is given, "
"only every n-th regular screen update is performed, which can be used to "
"speed up the drawing of complex graphics. If *n* is 0, animation is turned "
"off and the screen is only updated by calling :func:`update`. If *delay* is "
"given, it sets the drawing delay, see :func:`delay`. When called without "
"arguments, return the current value of *n*."
msgstr ""
"タートルのアニメーションを有効または無効にし、描画の遅延時間を設定します。\n"
"*n* を指定すると、通常の画面更新のうち *n* 回に 1 回だけ更新を行います。\n"
"複雑な図形の描画を速くするために使えます。\n"
"*n* が 0 の場合はアニメーションを無効にし、:func:`update` を呼び出したときだ"
"け画面を更新します。\n"
"*delay* を指定すると、描画の遅延時間を設定します (:func:`delay` を参照)。\n"
"引数なしで呼び出すと、現在の *n* の値を返します。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.tracer(8, 25)\n"
">>> dist = 2\n"
">>> for i in range(200):\n"
"...     fd(dist)\n"
"...     rt(90)\n"
"...     dist += 2"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.tracer(8, 25)\n"
">>> dist = 2\n"
">>> for i in range(200):\n"
"...     fd(dist)\n"
"...     rt(90)\n"
"...     dist += 2"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1841
msgid "Perform a TurtleScreen update. To be used when tracer is turned off."
msgstr "TurtleScreen の更新を実行します。トレーサーがオフの時に使われます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1843
msgid "See also the RawTurtle/Turtle method :func:`speed`."
msgstr "RawTurtle/Turtle のメソッド :func:`speed` も参照して下さい。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1847
msgid "Using screen events"
msgstr "スクリーンイベントを利用する"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1851
msgid ""
"Set focus on TurtleScreen (in order to collect key-events).  Dummy arguments "
"are provided in order to be able to pass :func:`listen` to the onclick "
"method."
msgstr ""
"TurtleScreen に(キー・イベントを収集するために)フォーカスします。ダミー引数"
"は :func:`listen` を onclick メソッドに渡せるようにするためのものです。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1858 ../../library/turtle.rst:1878
msgid "a function with no arguments or ``None``"
msgstr "引数なしの関数または ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1859 ../../library/turtle.rst:1879
msgid "a string: key (e.g. \"a\") or key-symbol (e.g. \"space\")"
msgstr "文字列: キー (例 \"a\") またはキー・シンボル (例 \"space\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1861
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to key-release event of key.  If *fun* is ``None``, event "
"bindings are removed. Remark: in order to be able to register key-events, "
"TurtleScreen must have the focus. (See method :func:`listen`.)"
msgstr ""
"*fun* を指定されたキーのキーリリース(key-release)イベントに束縛します。 "
"*fun* が ``None`` ならばイベント束縛は除かれます。注意: キー・イベントを登録"
"できるようにするためには TurtleScreen はフォーカスを持っていないとなりません"
"(:func:`listen` を参照)。"

msgid ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkey(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"
msgstr ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkey(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"

msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to key-press event of key if key is given, or to any key-press-"
"event if no key is given. Remark: in order to be able to register key-"
"events, TurtleScreen must have focus. (See method :func:`listen`.)"
msgstr ""
"``key`` を指定した場合はそのキーの押下イベントに、指定しなければ任意のキーの"
"押下イベントに *fun* を束縛します。\n"
"キーイベントを受け取るには、TurtleScreen にフォーカスが必要です (:func:"
"`listen` を参照)。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1886
msgid ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkey(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-click events on this screen. *fun* is called with the "
"coordinates of the clicked point on the canvas. If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the number of the mouse button and "
"defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If *add* is ``True``, a new binding is "
"added, otherwise it replaces a former binding."
msgstr ""
"この画面上のマウスクリックイベントに *fun* を束縛します。\n"
"*fun* は、クリックされた点のキャンバス上の座標を引数として呼び出されます。\n"
"*fun* が ``None`` の場合は、既存の束縛を削除します。\n"
"*btn* はマウスボタンの番号で、デフォルトは左ボタンを表す 1 です。\n"
"*add* が ``True`` の場合は新しい束縛を追加し、それ以外の場合は以前の束縛を置"
"き換えます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1909
msgid ""
"Example for a TurtleScreen instance named ``screen`` and a Turtle instance "
"named ``turtle``:"
msgstr ""
"Example for a ``screen`` という名の TurtleScreen インスタンスと ``turtle`` と"
"いう名前の Turtle インスタンスの例:"

msgid ""
">>> screen.onclick(turtle.goto) # Subsequently clicking into the "
"TurtleScreen will\n"
">>>                             # make the turtle move to the clicked "
"point.\n"
">>> screen.onclick(None)        # remove event binding again"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.onclick(turtle.goto) # これ以降、TurtleScreen をクリックすると\n"
">>>                             # その点にタートルが移動する\n"
">>> screen.onclick(None)        # イベントの束縛を削除する"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1920
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``onscreenclick``.  The global function ``onclick`` is another one "
"derived from the Turtle method ``onclick``."
msgstr ""
"この TurtleScreen メソッドはグローバル関数としては ``onscreenclick`` という名"
"前でだけ使えます。グローバル関数 ``onclick`` は Turtle メソッドの "
"``onclick`` から派生した別ものです。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1927
msgid "a function with no arguments"
msgstr "引数なし関数"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1928
msgid "a number >= 0"
msgstr "数 >= 0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1930
msgid "Install a timer that calls *fun* after *t* milliseconds."
msgstr "*t* ミリ秒後に *fun* を呼び出すタイマーを仕掛けます。"

msgid ""
">>> running = True\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     if running:\n"
"...         fd(50)\n"
"...         lt(60)\n"
"...         screen.ontimer(f, 250)\n"
">>> f()   ### makes the turtle march around\n"
">>> running = False"
msgstr ""
">>> running = True\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     if running:\n"
"...         fd(50)\n"
"...         lt(60)\n"
"...         screen.ontimer(f, 250)\n"
">>> f()   ### タートルを歩き回らせる\n"
">>> running = False"

msgid ""
"Start the event loop by calling Tkinter's :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.mainloop` "
"method. Must be the last statement in a turtle graphics program. Must *not* "
"be used if a script is run from within IDLE in -n mode (see :ref:`idle-no-"
"subprocess`)."
msgstr ""
"Tkinter の :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.mainloop` メソッドを呼び出してイベントループ"
"を開始します。\n"
"タートルグラフィックスのプログラムでは最後の文にしなければなりません。\n"
"IDLE の -n モードでスクリプトを実行する場合は、使っては *いけません* (:ref:"
"`idle-no-subprocess` を参照)。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1955
msgid "Input methods"
msgstr "入力メソッド"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1959 ../../library/turtle.rst:1960
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1971 ../../library/turtle.rst:1972
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2069 ../../library/turtle.rst:2202
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2258
msgid "a string"
msgstr "文字列"

msgid ""
"Pop up a dialog window for input of a string. *title* is the title of the "
"dialog window and *prompt* is a text describing what information to input. "
"Return the string entered. If the dialog is canceled, return ``None``. ::"
msgstr ""
"文字列を入力するダイアログウィンドウを表示します。\n"
"*title* はダイアログのタイトル、*prompt* は入力する情報を説明するテキストで"
"す。\n"
"入力された文字列を返します。\n"
"ダイアログがキャンセルされた場合は ``None`` を返します。 ::"

msgid ">>> screen.textinput(\"NIM\", \"Name of first player:\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.textinput(\"NIM\", \"Name of first player:\")"

msgid ""
"Pop up a dialog window for input of a number. *title* is the title of the "
"dialog window and *prompt* is a text describing what numerical information "
"to input. *default* is the default value, *minval* and *maxval* are the "
"minimum and maximum values for input. If these are given, the number entered "
"must be between *minval* and *maxval*. If not, a hint is issued and the "
"dialog remains open for correction. Return the number entered. If the dialog "
"is canceled, return ``None``. ::"
msgstr ""
"数値を入力するダイアログウィンドウを表示します。\n"
"*title* はダイアログのタイトル、*prompt* は入力する数値情報を説明するテキスト"
"です。\n"
"*default* はデフォルト値、*minval* と *maxval* は入力の最小値と最大値です。\n"
"これらを指定した場合、入力する数値は *minval* から *maxval* の範囲内でなけれ"
"ばなりません。\n"
"範囲外の値が入力されると、ヒントを表示し、修正できるようにダイアログを開いた"
"ままにします。\n"
"入力された数値を返します。\n"
"ダイアログがキャンセルされた場合は ``None`` を返します。 ::"

msgid ""
">>> screen.numinput(\"Poker\", \"Your stakes:\", 1000, minval=10, "
"maxval=10000)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.numinput(\"Poker\", \"Your stakes:\", 1000, minval=10, "
"maxval=10000)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1989
msgid "Settings and special methods"
msgstr "設定と特殊なメソッド"

msgid "a string or ``None``"
msgstr "文字列または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Set the turtle mode and perform a reset. *mode* is one of the strings "
"\"standard\", \"logo\" or \"world\". If *mode* is not given, return the "
"current mode."
msgstr ""
"タートルのモードを設定し、リセットします。\n"
"*mode* は文字列 \"standard\"、\"logo\"、\"world\" のいずれかです。\n"
"*mode* を指定しなければ、現在のモードを返します。"

msgid ""
"Mode \"standard\" is compatible with the old :mod:`!turtle` module. Mode "
"\"logo\" is compatible with most Logo turtle graphics. Mode \"world\" uses "
"user-defined world coordinates, see :func:`setworldcoordinates`. In this "
"mode, angles appear distorted if the x and y units are not of equal length."
msgstr ""
"\"standard\" モードは古い :mod:`!turtle` モジュールと互換性があります。\n"
"\"logo\" モードは多くの Logo のタートルグラフィックスと互換性があります。\n"
"\"world\" モードはユーザー定義のワールド座標を使います (:func:"
"`setworldcoordinates` を参照)。\n"
"このモードでは、x と y の単位の長さが等しくない場合、角度が歪んで見えます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2005
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "モード"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2005
msgid "Initial turtle heading"
msgstr "タートルの向きの初期値"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2005
msgid "positive angles"
msgstr "正の角度"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2007
msgid "\"standard\""
msgstr "\"standard\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2007
msgid "to the right (east)"
msgstr "右 (東) 向き"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2007
msgid "counterclockwise"
msgstr "反時計回り"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2008
msgid "\"logo\""
msgstr "\"logo\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2008
msgid "upward    (north)"
msgstr "上 (北) 向き"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2008
msgid "clockwise"
msgstr "時計回り"

msgid ""
">>> mode(\"logo\")  # resets turtle heading to north\n"
">>> mode()\n"
"'logo'"
msgstr ""
">>> mode(\"logo\")  # タートルの向きを北にリセットする\n"
">>> mode()\n"
"'logo'"

msgid ""
"Return the colormode or set it to 1.0 or 255. After setting it, the *r*, *g* "
"and *b* values of color triples have to be between 0 and *cmode*."
msgstr ""
"カラーモードを取得するか、1.0 または 255 に設定します。\n"
"設定後は、色を表す三つ組の *r*、*g*、*b* の値を 0 から *cmode* の範囲内にする"
"必要があります。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.colormode(1)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240, 160, 80)\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"     ...\n"
"TurtleGraphicsError: bad color sequence: (240, 160, 80)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> screen.colormode(255)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"255\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240,160,80)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.colormode(1)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240, 160, 80)\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"     ...\n"
"TurtleGraphicsError: bad color sequence: (240, 160, 80)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> screen.colormode(255)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"255\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240,160,80)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2044
msgid ""
"Return the Canvas of this TurtleScreen.  Useful for insiders who know what "
"to do with a Tkinter Canvas."
msgstr ""
"この TurtleScreen の Canvas を返します。Tkinter の Canvas を使って何をするか"
"知っている人には有用です。"

msgid ""
">>> cv = screen.getcanvas()\n"
">>> cv\n"
"<turtle.ScrolledCanvas object ...>"
msgstr ""
">>> cv = screen.getcanvas()\n"
">>> cv\n"
"<turtle.ScrolledCanvas object ...>"

msgid "Return a list of names of all currently available turtle shapes."
msgstr "現在利用できるすべてのタートルの形状の名前を、リストで返します。"

msgid ""
">>> screen.getshapes()\n"
"['arrow', 'blank', 'circle', ..., 'turtle']"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.getshapes()\n"
"['arrow', 'blank', 'circle', ..., 'turtle']"

msgid ""
"a string, a tuple of pairs of numbers, a :class:`Shape` object or ``None``"
msgstr "文字列、数値ペアのタプル、:class:`Shape` オブジェクト、または ``None``"

msgid ""
"Add a turtle shape to the TurtleScreen's shape list. It can be called in "
"four different ways:"
msgstr ""
"TurtleScreen の形状リストに、タートルの形状を追加します。\n"
"呼び出し方は 4 通りあります。"

msgid ""
"*name* is the name of an image file (PNG, GIF, PGM, and PPM) and *shape* is "
"``None``: Install the corresponding image shape. ::"
msgstr ""
"*name* が画像ファイル (PNG、GIF、PGM、PPM) の名前で *shape* が ``None`` の場"
"合: 対応する画像の形状を登録します。 ::"

msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle.gif\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle.gif\")"

msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is the name of an image file (PNG, "
"GIF, PGM, and PPM): Install the corresponding image shape. ::"
msgstr ""
"*name* が任意の文字列で *shape* が画像ファイル (PNG、GIF、PGM、PPM) の名前の"
"場合: 対応する画像の形状を登録します。 ::"

msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle\", \"turtle.gif\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle\", \"turtle.gif\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2086
msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is a tuple of pairs of "
"coordinates: Install the corresponding polygon shape."
msgstr ""
"*name* が任意の文字列で *shape* が座標ペアのタプル: 対応する多角形を取り込み"
"ます。"

msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"triangle\", ((5,-3), (0,5), (-5,-3)))"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"triangle\", ((5,-3), (0,5), (-5,-3)))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2094
msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is a (compound) :class:`Shape` "
"object: Install the corresponding compound shape."
msgstr ""
"*name* が任意の文字列で *shape* が (合成形の) :class:`Shape` オブジェクト: 対"
"応する合成形を取り込みます。"

msgid ""
"Image shapes do not rotate when turning the turtle, so they do not display "
"the heading of the turtle. To use a registered shape, call :func:`shape` "
"with its name."
msgstr ""
"画像の形状はタートルの向きを変えても回転しないため、タートルの向きを表しませ"
"ん。\n"
"登録した形状を使うには、その名前を渡して :func:`shape` を呼び出してください。"

msgid ""
"Added support for PNG, PGM, and PPM image formats. Both a shape name and an "
"image file name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"PNG、PGM、PPM の画像形式のサポートが追加されました。\n"
"形状名と画像ファイル名の両方を指定できるようになりました。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2108
msgid "Return the list of turtles on the screen."
msgstr "スクリーン上のタートルのリストを返します。"

msgid ""
">>> for turtle in screen.turtles():\n"
"...     turtle.color(\"red\")"
msgstr ""
">>> for turtle in screen.turtles():\n"
"...     turtle.color(\"red\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2119
msgid "Return the height of the turtle window. ::"
msgstr "タートルウィンドウの高さを返します。 ::"

msgid ""
">>> screen.window_height()\n"
"480"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.window_height()\n"
"480"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2127
msgid "Return the width of the turtle window. ::"
msgstr "タートルウィンドウの幅を返します。 ::"

msgid ""
">>> screen.window_width()\n"
"640"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.window_width()\n"
"640"

msgid "Screen-only methods"
msgstr "Screen 専用のメソッド"

msgid "Close the turtle graphics window."
msgstr "タートルグラフィックスのウィンドウを閉じます。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2146
